#: ../plugins/index.rst:7
#: 9f286384bdcf4357a67512dadc464885
msgid ":doc:`Plugins documentation <index>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Dokumentacija vtičnikov <index>`"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:13
#: 77622bd4ee3c4eb7b42fec1153fe57da
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Vtičniki"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:15
#: 20eaa90f7f0143dcb3a40529ec4581d1
msgid "Plugins system allows to extend Galette with specific features that would not be useful for most of the users. Incompatible plugins will automatically be disabled, in which case you should consider upgrading to a more recent version."
msgstr ""
"Sistem vtičnikov omogoča razširitev Galette s specifičnimi funkcijami, ki "
"večini uporabnikov ne bi bile uporabne. Nezdružljivi vtičniki bodo samodejno "
"onemogočeni, v tem primeru pa razmislite o nadgradnji na novejšo različico."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:17
#: 87b1d92dfaf04f2e8c125aee56676a15
msgid "Each plugin is a simple directory in ``{galette}/plugins/``, then refer to the plugin documentation to install it."
msgstr ""
"Vsak vtičnik je preprost imenik v ``{galette}/plugins/``, nato pa glejte "
"dokumentacijo vtičnika, da ga namestite."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:19
#: 057d6d23fa97483b9cb5c48e20b3f8fd
msgid "You can disable a plugin creating a ``_disabled`` file in its directory."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik lahko onemogočite tako, da v njegovem imeniku ustvarite datoteko "
"``_disabled``."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:23
#: 378be41e5958451190d604c0fef9bf95
msgid "Official Plugins"
msgstr "Uradni vtičniki"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:25
#: 389cfb939ad743fc82512bd709d2931f
msgid "Official plugins are developed and maintained by the Galette team. Available official plugins are:"
msgstr ""
"Uradne vtičnike razvija in vzdržuje ekipa Galette. Razpoložljivi uradni "
"vtičniki so:"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:40
#: 4c9dbe22076d44539ce37403ed706f28
msgid "Third party plugins"
msgstr "Vtičniki tretjih oseb"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:42
#: 8f005e5b645142d4884d77ae4b499695
msgid "Third party plugins are developed and maintained by community members. Some of them may not be translated, or available on only one database engine."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnike tretjih oseb razvijajo in vzdržujejo člani skupnosti. Nekateri od "
"njih morda niso prevedeni ali pa so na voljo samo v enem mehanizmu zbirke "
"podatkov."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:44
#: 768253b9ab484890b2d7ecfeae4ebfb3
msgid "`oAuth2 <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-oauth2/>`_ (Galette act as an oAuth2 provider),"
msgstr ""
"`oAuth2 <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-oauth2/>`_ (Galette "
"deluje kot ponudnik oAuth2),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:45
#: 768253b9ab484890b2d7ecfeae4ebfb3
msgid "`Stripe <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-stripe/>`_ (handle `Stripe payments <https://stripe.com/>`_),"
msgstr ""
"`Stripe <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-stripe/>`_ (obravnava "
"`plačila Stripe <https://stripe.com/>`_),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:46
#: dde62501fdd9413faa3dba108c8a4178
msgid "`HelloAsso <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-helloasso/>`_ (handle `HelloAsso payments <https://www.helloasso.com/>`_),"
msgstr ""
"`HelloAsso <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-helloasso/>`_ (handle "
"`HelloAsso payments <https://www.helloasso.com/>`_),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:47
#: ff077e88788b40fd9c58ea96da46d00d
msgid "`LegalNotices <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-legalnotices/>`_ (manage legal notices pages),"
msgstr ""
"`LegalNotices <https://galette-community.github.io/plugin-legalnotices/>`_ "
"(manage legal notices pages),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:49
#: 768253b9ab484890b2d7ecfeae4ebfb3
msgid "A `Github community <https://github.com/galette-community/>`_ has been created to :doc:`manage third party plugins <plugins-tiers>`, if you want to add your plugin."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjena je bila `skupnost Github <https://github.com/galette-community/>"
"`_ za :doc:`upravljanje vtičnikov tretjih oseb <plugins-tiers>`, če želite "
"dodati svoj vtičnik."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:60
#: 699c14f189ea4781b54ab828faa579e7
msgid "Plugins management interface"
msgstr "Vmesnik za upravljanje vtičnikov"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:62
#: f0d2b7511fad4536af2cd3f8b589e9f7
msgid "A plugins management interface is provided, you will find it from the dashboard or in the configuration menu. After you have downloaded plugin(s) in Galette ``plugins`` directory, a list will be displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Na voljo je vmesnik za upravljanje vtičnikov, ki ga najdete na nadzorni "
"plošči ali v meniju za konfiguracijo. Ko prenesete vtičnike v imenik "
"``plugins`` Galette, se bo prikazal seznam:"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:64
#: b962fd6fbc234ffbb40ed53c38e688ac
msgid "Plugins management"
msgstr "Upravljanje vtičnikov"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:69
#: 3701d8b0588649ff914801cc8acd029a
msgid "If web server has read access to your plugins directory, then you can enable or disable any plugin from the related icon."
msgstr ""
"Če ima spletni strežnik dostop za branje do vašega imenika z vtičniki, lahko "
"kateri koli vtičnik omogočite ali onemogočite s pomočjo ustrezne ikone."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:71
#: 91de008c63ed4ced97e979796d17ed4c
msgid "If plugin requires a database to work, you can play installation and update scripts from the interface."
msgstr ""
"Če vtičnik za delovanje potrebuje bazo podatkov, lahko namestitvene in "
"posodobitvene skripte predvajate iz vmesnika."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:73
#: 45b47f458532489ba9be241f040ee1e5
msgid "Database ACLs will then be checked. Unlike Galette, no information will be asked to you, since all is already available from your current instance."
msgstr ""
"Nato bodo preverjeni ACL-ji baze podatkov. Za razliko od Galette vam ne bodo "
"zahtevani nobeni podatki, saj so vsi podatki že na voljo iz vaše trenutne "
"instance."
